# Anchored: the signed-APK output dir only. Android Studio's template ships
# this unanchored as `release/`, which also matches app/src/release/ — the
# release source set — silently un-tracking its sources. Local builds keep
# working because the files are on disk; only a clean checkout fails.
/app/release/

